# Consuming Aberration: "Whenever you cast a spell" is its controller's spells only. Bot2 casts a Lightning Bolt on its own turn 4
# (at Bot1's face), and Bot1's Aberration mills nothing: Bot2's library keeps its Island on top and its graveyard has only the
# Bolt it cast on turn 2 and this one, so the Aberration is a 2/2.

