Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Consuming Aberration
Ornithopter
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Island
Island
Island x10

